Day 60 - Internet Gateway Investigation
Objective
Understand the role of an Internet Gateway in AWS networking.

Investigation
Verified Public IP address
Reviewed Security Group rules
Checked Route Table configuration
Verified Internet Gateway attachment
Root Cause
The Internet Gateway was missing, detached, or incorrectly configured.

Resolution
Corrected the Internet Gateway configuration and restored connectivity.

Key Takeaway
Internet access requires:

Public IP
Security Group
Route Table
Internet Gateway
